Implementation Plan - Flutter Mobile Application (Material 3 Auth & Clean Architecture)
Create a production-ready Flutter mobile/web project in mobile/ featuring Material 3, 
clean folder architecture, responsive layout (mobile/tablet/desktop), state management, 
form validation, loading overlay/states, forgot password dialog, and Google login integration.

