User Review Required
NOTE

The Flutter project will be initialized in mobile/ within the repository root so it co-exists cleanly with existing Client and Server folders.

IMPORTANT

The project will use provider for state management, google_sign_in / SVG assets for Google authentication styling, and flutter_spinkit or built-in M3 CircularProgressIndicator for polished loading states.

