Verification Plan
Automated Tests
Run flutter create mobile to set up project scaffold.
Run flutter analyze inside mobile/ to verify zero compilation errors or lint issues.
Run flutter test if unit tests are added for validators.dart and AuthProvider.
Manual Verification
Run flutter run -d chrome or desktop device to verify responsive layout across screen resizes.
Test Form Validation:
Attempt submission with empty email/password.
Enter invalid email format (e.g. test@com) -> verify error banner/text.
Enter short password -> verify password validation rule.
Test Auth Flows:
Submit valid credentials -> verify loading spinner -> verify navigation to HomeScreen.
Tap "Forgot Password?" -> enter email -> verify reset simulation and toast.
Tap "Sign in with Google" -> verify social auth trigger & loading state -> navigate to HomeScreen.
Tap "Logout" -> verify returning to LoginScreen.